 ent.\nParticipants will receive a certificate of participation upon progra
 m completion\, but this program does not contribute to a WRAP certificate.
  Find more WRAP program options at TPL\nhere.\nTTC Presto tickets will be 
 provided. Snacks and refreshments are provided for all participants. Ing
 redient lists will be available at the program.\nThis program is in coll
