BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Creative Writing Club: Write Better Faster with Maaja Wentz
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261120T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261120T190000
UID:6ab144540fe10113c002e841@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Boost your productivity\, overcome writing blocks\, and finall
 y finish the projects that matter most.\nDo you have a manuscript collecti
 ng dust in a drawer? Do you find it easier to start new writing projects t
 han to complete existing ones? Whether you're working on a novel\, memoir\
 , article\, play\, or personal writing project\, this interactive workshop
  will help you build a sustainable writing practice and make meaningful pr
 ogress toward your goals.\nLed by writer and instructor Maaja Wentz\, this
  responsive workshop explores the habits\, mindsets\, and strategies that 
 help writers write more efficiently without sacrificing quality. Through d
 iscussion and reflection\, participants will identify personal challenges\
 , discover new approaches to creative flow\, and learn practical technique
 s for increasing productivity.\nLeave with a personalized plan to help you
  write more confidently\, consistently\, and efficiently\, whether your go
 al is to finish a short piece or complete a book-length project. Writing i
 s more enjoyable when it gets done!\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe p
 ersonal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Librar
 y under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The
  information will only be used for event and program registration\, delive
 ry and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your informatio
 n can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-59
 81\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Malvern
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ab144540fe10113c002e841
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cercle de conversation : Parlons cinéma ! French Conversation Cir
 cle
